{"seq":1,"slug":"discrete-mathematics","title":"离散数学基础","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":5,"docCount":18,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics","rating":{"composite":3.87,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.42,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 离散数学基础 简介\n\n离散数学是计算机科学的数学基石，研究的是离散的、非连续的数学结构。与微积分处理连续变化不同，离散数学关注的是可数的、分立的对象及其关系。无论是算法设计、数据库理论、编译器构造还是密码学，离散数学都提供了不可或缺的形式化工具和推理方法。\n\n本知识库面向具有一定编程经验的中级开发者，尤其适合希望夯实计算机科学理论基础、提升算法设计能力、或准备技术面试的程序员。学习离散数学不需要高深的数学背景，但需要耐心和严谨的逻辑思维。\n\n第1章**逻辑与证明**从命题逻辑和谓词逻辑入手，建立形式化推理的基本功，掌握直接证明、归纳证明等核心证明技术，为后续所有章节的严格论证打下基础。\n\n第2章**集合与关系**介绍集合论的基本概念、关系的各种性质、函数的形式化定义以及偏序结构，这些是理解数据结构和数据库理论的前置知识。\n\n第3章**组合数学**聚焦计数方法，从基本计数原理到排列组合，再到鸽巢原理、容斥原理和生成函数，系统构建分析算法复杂度和概率问题所需的计数工具箱。\n\n第4章**图论基础**涵盖图的基本概念、遍历算法、树与生成树以及图着色问题，这些知识直接对应网络分析、路径规划、任务调度等大量工程场景。\n\n第5章**数论与代数结构**讨论整除性、模运算以及群、环等代数结构的入门知识，它们是密码学、编码理论和哈希算法的数学根基。\n\n推荐的学习路径是从第1章开始顺序阅读，因为逻辑与证明是所有后续内容的基础。第2章和第3章可以并行学习，第4章依赖于前三章的基本概念，第5章则相对独立，可根据兴趣灵活安排。建议每完成一章后回顾该章的核心定理和证明思路，将理论与实际编程问题结合思考。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"logic-and-proofs","title":"逻辑与证明","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/logic-and-proofs","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"propositional-logic","title":"命题逻辑","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/logic-and-proofs/propositional-logic"},{"seq":2,"slug":"predicate-logic","title":"谓词逻辑","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/logic-and-proofs/predicate-logic"},{"seq":3,"slug":"proof-techniques","title":"证明技术","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/logic-and-proofs/proof-techniques"},{"seq":4,"slug":"logical-reasoning","title":"逻辑推理","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/logic-and-proofs/logical-reasoning"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"sets-and-relations","title":"集合与关系","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/sets-and-relations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"set-theory","title":"集合论基础","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/sets-and-relations/set-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"relations","title":"关系","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/sets-and-relations/relations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"functions","title":"函数","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/sets-and-relations/functions"},{"seq":4,"slug":"partial-orders","title":"偏序与格","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/sets-and-relations/partial-orders"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"combinatorics","title":"组合数学","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/combinatorics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"counting-principles","title":"计数原理","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/combinatorics/counting-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"permutations-combinations","title":"排列与组合","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/combinatorics/permutations-combinations"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pigeonhole-inclusion-exclusion","title":"鸽巢原理与容斥原理","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/combinatorics/pigeonhole-inclusion-exclusion"},{"seq":4,"slug":"generating-functions","title":"生成函数","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/combinatorics/generating-functions"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"graph-theory","title":"图论基础","docCount":4,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/graph-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-concepts","title":"图的基本概念","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/graph-theory/graph-concepts"},{"seq":2,"slug":"graph-traversal","title":"图的遍历","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/graph-theory/graph-traversal"},{"seq":3,"slug":"trees-and-spanning","title":"树与生成树","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/graph-theory/trees-and-spanning"},{"seq":4,"slug":"graph-coloring","title":"图着色与匹配","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/graph-theory/graph-coloring"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"number-theory","title":"数论与代数结构","docCount":2,"url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/number-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"divisibility-and-modular","title":"整除性与模运算","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/number-theory/divisibility-and-modular"},{"seq":2,"slug":"algebraic-structures","title":"代数结构","url":"/h/cs-fundamentals/discrete-mathematics/number-theory/algebraic-structures"}]}]}